      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="eto-text-section">
        <h2 class="eto-section-title">About Us</h2>
        <p class="eto-text-p">Established in 2005, ETO Doors manufactures and sells entryways for residential and commercial spaces. With more than a million doors sold to customers with a wide range of budgets, ETO knows how to deliver the door perfect for your needs and taste. Our catalog of interior and exterior doors, garage doors, sidelites, transoms, and hardware come to consumers at unbeatable prices.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">To keep the people important to you safe at home or in the workspace, ETO carries fire and impact rated doors in a range of options and styles. Our promise of greener living means we also carry Energy Star rated doors, and we're also certified by the Forest Stewardship Council, making us one of only a handful of door manufacturers that guarantees accountability in managing where we source our wood.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">In addition to our online store, ETO Doors has showrooms in Los Angeles, Las Vegas, and New York. To learn more about us, click on informational tabs in the footer, check us out on Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, Pinterest, Google+, Houzz.com, or visit our <strong>Contact</strong> page to sign up for our newsletter or ask a question with a guaranteed quick response. You may also engage our Live Customer Support at the lower right-hand corner of any page.</p>
      </div>


