           As for our facility itself, ETO Doors now hosts numerous solar panels on its roof tops. Solar panels generate electricity by channeling natural sunlight. These panels are environment-friendly because they do not pollute or require the use of non-replenishable resources. Los Angeles has an average of 320 full sunny days per year, giving us the perfect climate to use our solar panels to go green.<br><br>
