       <h3 style="font-size: 20px; color: #333; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">Our 300,000 Sq/Ft State of the Art Door Manufacturing Facility</h3>
       
       <div style="overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <img src="{{ 'imagine1123.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="ETO Manufacturing Facility" style="float: left; max-width: 350px; margin: 0 20px 15px 0;">
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors was founded in 2005 on the principles of maintaining a vast stock of high end custom doors at the lowest possible prices in the market. The founders of our door company recognized a market need for a dependable source for top quality doors that can be delivered to the customer within days, not months.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">Since our inception, we have consistently added thousands of additional doors in new models and sizes to our inventory every month to meet customer demands. Today ETO has the ability to fulfill virtually any door needs for any residential or commercial project, and customers can read ETO Doors reviews online to get the inside information on their favorite brands.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors Corp. was one of the first <strong>door manufacturers</strong> to offer a <strong>full</strong> line of doors online. We pride <strong>ourselves</strong> on a great selection of front door systems, wood doors, exterior doors, entry doors, interior doors, french doors and custom doors. Our vast stock of doors and aggressive industry leading prices (available due to our large volume of sales) have attributed to success/growth of our business. ETO has become the industry-leader in quality, design and creation of customized wooden doors.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">Each member of our staff has been thoroughly trained and is a knowledgeable door professional. Our three hundred thousand square-foot state-of-the-art facility located in downtown Los Angeles includes the latest pre-hanging machinery available in door technology today.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">Perhaps what differentiates ETO most from other door companies is our constant pursuit to offer industry leading doors constructions for prices below wholesale. Our nationwide presence and the sale of thousands of doors every month allow us to provide the highest quality products at the guaranteed lowest price, nationwide.</p>
       </div>

