          <p class="eto-text-p">Please be assured that ETO Doors Corp. is committed to the protection of the Rain Forest. Strict compliance is maintained with all foreign government regulations to protect the Rain Forest. None of the timber used to produce ETO Doors is listed as endangered.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors is a partner in working towards a "Green" environment. All of our Brazilian Mahogany doors are produced from sustainable wood products and are supplied from re-harvesting plants in South America.</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors has provided doors to numerous projects nationwide that have been "LEED" Certified (Platinum: the highest level of Green Certification attainable).</p>
          
          <p class="eto-text-p">At ETO Doors we believe our reputation rests on every door we sell. We take pride in offering a "1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty" on all of our doors. ETO Doors also offers a formal best price guarantee.</p>
