     <div id="eto-warranty-content" style="display: none; color: #333; font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
           <span style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">Interior and Exterior Door Slab and System 1-Year Limited Warranty</span>
